cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and cite the original dataset and MiniRocket separately."
title: "MIRA-CSI: Missingness-Informed Recognition of Activities from Wi-Fi CSI"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/ABDESSAMAD-BOURKIBATE/mira-csi"
url: "https://github.com/ABDESSAMAD-BOURKIBATE/mira-csi"
authors:
  - family-names: Bourkibate
    given-names: Abdessamad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6186-8071"
abstract: "Experimental offline Wi-Fi CSI activity recognition, including spectral variant E with observed-endpoint features and a compact MLP. The original 60-fit comparison, 90-fit temporal component study, 75-fit A–E extension and an additional 15-configuration power18 MiniRocket reference retain their separate protocols and limitations. A 32-page unreviewed author manuscript and four-page result supplement accompany the software. The post-hoc E/reference contrast includes different training and loss-treatment policies; it does not establish SOTA, a causal architectural effect or patent novelty. No DOI is assigned."
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - Wi-Fi CSI
  - activity recognition
  - missing data
  - reproducibility
